From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:30:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] videoplayer: compare mastering luminance by value

VideoPicture::CompareDisplayMetadata compared the mastering display's
luminance by numerator and denominator. A stream that repeats the same
luminance as another fraction (1000/1, then 10000000/10000) made two
pictures with the same metadata differ, IsSameParams failed and
CRenderManager::Configure set the renderer up again: a periodic stutter
on such HDR10 streams.

The values are compared with av_cmp_q, as CDVDStreamInfo::Equal already
does for the stream's metadata (CroqueMr's CB1 fixed it the same way,
04f581e55b). Fields equal as they are stay equal, so a zero denominator,
which av_cmp_q does not order, changes nothing.
---
 .../VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.cpp    | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.cpp
index a41939d..7aa0292 100644
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodec.cpp
@@ -90,10 +90,14 @@ bool VideoPicture::CompareDisplayMetadata(const VideoPicture& pic) const
     return true;
 
   // both this and pic has display metadata
-  return this->displayMetadata.max_luminance.num == pic.displayMetadata.max_luminance.num &&
-         this->displayMetadata.max_luminance.den == pic.displayMetadata.max_luminance.den &&
-         this->displayMetadata.min_luminance.num == pic.displayMetadata.min_luminance.num &&
-         this->displayMetadata.min_luminance.den == pic.displayMetadata.min_luminance.den;
+  // A stream may repeat its mastering luminance as another fraction (1000/1, then 10000000/10000):
+  // compare the values, as CDVDStreamInfo::Equal does, or the renderer is configured again each
+  // time (a periodic stutter). Equal fields stay equal: av_cmp_q has no order for a zero
+  // denominator.
+  const auto same = [](const AVRational& a, const AVRational& b)
+  { return (a.num == b.num && a.den == b.den) || av_cmp_q(a, b) == 0; };
+  return same(this->displayMetadata.max_luminance, pic.displayMetadata.max_luminance) &&
+         same(this->displayMetadata.min_luminance, pic.displayMetadata.min_luminance);
 }
 
 bool VideoPicture::IsSameParams(const VideoPicture& pic) const
